{"src":"en","tgt":"ro","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":164500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ro","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6140.470592,"text":"But after losing the captain's wicket, India only made 36 runs, losing seven was a big"},{"kind":"text","t":6763.707023999999,"text":"Dar după pierderea wicket-ului căpitanului, India a reușit doar 36 de run-uri, pierderea a șapte fiind o lovitură mare"},{"kind":"audio","t":6965.199648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6966.596866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":6967.874062000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6969.453364000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6970.965134,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6972.472205,"samples":30371,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"input","t":12742.769087,"text":"They usually have special food, drink, and entertainment offers to keep guests in a good mood and to keep them at the premise."},{"kind":"text","t":13473.41719,"text":"De obicei, au oferte speciale de mâncare, băutură și divertisment pentru a menține oaspeții într-o stare de spirit bună și pentru a îi păstra în incintă."},{"kind":"audio","t":13671.324903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13672.646929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13674.271012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13675.854924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13677.472006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13679.12738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13680.294873,"samples":25746,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"input","t":19232.934545999997,"text":"Del Potro has the early advantage in the second set, but this is too required a tie break after"},{"kind":"text","t":19711.68415,"text":"Del Potro are avantajul în începutul setului al doilea, dar acest lucru a dus la un tie-break după care"},{"kind":"audio","t":19847.581374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19848.891871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19850.475232999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19852.092435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19853.232927999998,"samples":24408,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"input","t":25299.054572,"text":"The internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"text","t":25603.874175999998,"text":"Internetul combină elemente de comunicare de masă și interpersonală."},{"kind":"audio","t":25706.308827,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25707.744786000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25709.504760999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25709.664504,"samples":5628,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":34441.198636,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches those found in urine of affected pets when compared by infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"text","t":35137.822354,"text":"Compoziția acestor cristale corespunde cu cea a celor găsite în urina animalelor de companie afectate, atunci când sunt comparate prin spectroscopie infraroșie."},{"kind":"audio","t":35343.890251000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35345.295419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35346.874981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35348.550605000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":35350.110276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35351.80414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35353.355391000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35353.925443,"samples":14433,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":36884.063963,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"text","t":37060.34995,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"audio","t":37084.17126,"samples":16439,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":42295.810831,"text":"on some routes the larger companies have their own planes but for other routes and smaller firms there was a"},{"kind":"text","t":42782.703719000005,"text":"pe unele rute companiile mai mari au propriile avioane, dar pentru alte rute și firme mai mici a existat un"},{"kind":"audio","t":42920.607084,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42922.097504000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42923.693596000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42925.575724,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42926.915171,"samples":27752,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"input","t":49502.942568,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means that they tend to break up"},{"kind":"text","t":49915.160743,"text":"Unele atomi au nuclee instabile, ceea ce înseamnă că tind să se dezintegreze"},{"kind":"audio","t":50019.686196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50021.288328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50022.964342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50023.252818,"samples":9808,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":53496.735823,"text":"and break apart with little or no nudging."},{"kind":"text","t":53766.092633,"text":"și să se dezintegreze cu puțin sau deloc impuls."},{"kind":"audio","t":53843.411109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53844.770646000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53845.297877000005,"samples":14154,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":60648.843332000004,"text":"The same month saw another airliner overrun a runway at Moshland and strike a wall killing 17."},{"kind":"text","t":61281.421281,"text":"În aceeași lună, un alt avion de linie a părăsit pista de la Moshland și a lovit un perete, ucidând 17 persoane."},{"kind":"audio","t":61447.070075,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61448.466383,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61450.101606000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61451.726768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61453.347611000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61454.384202,"samples":22848,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"input","t":67215.023202,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":67739.073937,"text":"Aproape toate sunt plaje cu nisip, cu locuri sigure pentru înot, iar majoritatea au umbră oferită de"},{"kind":"audio","t":67873.739617,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67875.11020499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67876.8618,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":67878.625475,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67879.69681699999,"samples":22458,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"input","t":70275.277303,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":70418.935883,"text":"copacii pohika."},{"kind":"audio","t":70456.114661,"samples":29535,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1020},{"kind":"input","t":76435.024985,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby,"},{"kind":"text","t":76899.29215699999,"text":"Sporturile populare includ fotbalul, baschetul, voleiul, polo-ul pe apă, scrimă, rugby,"},{"kind":"audio","t":77027.33537399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77029.004687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77030.66983099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77032.283153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77032.89426599999,"samples":15492,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":80693.967766,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and F1."},{"kind":"text","t":81088.22619,"text":"ciclism, hochei pe gheață, hochei pe rolete și F1."},{"kind":"audio","t":81169.769241,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81171.07753699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81171.866773,"samples":18334,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":86523.806298,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":86902.714693,"text":"În climatul cald din Orientul Mijlociu, casa nu era atât de importantă."},{"kind":"audio","t":87003.066662,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87004.673314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87006.267776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87006.45694999999,"samples":8414,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":93197.133233,"text":"The lake lies 120 kilometers north of Peninsula."},{"kind":"text","t":93512.43235799999,"text":"Lacul se află la 120 de kilometri nord de Peninsula."},{"kind":"audio","t":93612.44111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93613.792007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93615.39317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93615.506662,"samples":5628,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":98314.891576,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":98833.831068,"text":"Sucul de varză își schimbă culoarea în funcție de cât de acid, bazic sau alcalin este substanța chimică."},{"kind":"audio","t":98969.868435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98971.160962,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98972.776784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98974.39948699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98975.36499599999,"samples":19950,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":105754.139553,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to be fully operational in September 2017 when the Brazilian custom checkpoints are expected to be finished."},{"kind":"text","t":106407.860567,"text":"Podul urmează să fie complet operațional în septembrie 2017, când se preconizează că punctele de control vamale braziliene vor fi finalizate."},{"kind":"audio","t":106609.30247099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106610.67633799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106612.25563999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106613.92006399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106615.56227699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106617.150499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106618.81208199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106619.443325,"samples":11925,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":113152.63818499999,"text":"The moisture on your hands will react with the outer layers, which will feel funny and form a sort of shell."},{"kind":"text","t":113834.72026999999,"text":"Umiditatea de pe mâinile tale va reacționa cu straturile exterioare, care vor avea o senzație ciudată și vor forma un fel de scoarță."},{"kind":"audio","t":114011.90099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114013.37082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114014.984862,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114016.59363399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114018.256778,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114019.898261,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114020.02462299999,"samples":4569,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":119603.58163599999,"text":"One bomb exploded outside the Governor's General's office."},{"kind":"text","t":119941.778371,"text":"O bombă a explodat în fața biroului Guvernatorului General."},{"kind":"audio","t":120033.375432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120034.881172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120036.384892,"samples":30873,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"input","t":125307.925284,"text":"The Moroccan Sultan rebuilt the city as Daru i Bayt"},{"kind":"text","t":125657.70945299999,"text":"Sultanul Marocului a reconstruit orașul sub numele de Daru i Bayt."},{"kind":"audio","t":125766.389037,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125768.153672,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125769.46381799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":125770.15862199999,"samples":17052,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":130426.32857999999,"text":"and it was given the name Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading bases."},{"kind":"text","t":130819.063071,"text":"și a primit numele de Casablanca de la comercianții spanioli care au stabilit baze comerciale."},{"kind":"audio","t":130949.77849799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130951.24784799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130952.88937099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130954.504673,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130954.66023599998,"samples":7133,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":142833.38258900002,"text":"He was greeted by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan-seng and discussed trade and terrorism issues with the Singapore Prime Minister Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"text","t":143533.80442300002,"text":"A fost primit de vicepremierul Singapurului, Wong Kan-seng, și a discutat probleme de comerț și terorism cu premierul Singapurului, Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"audio","t":143736.997046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143738.43146400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143740.028677,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":143741.640019,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143743.322103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":143744.951886,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143746.582388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143746.964186,"samples":11647,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":154243.16633900002,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":154830.394869,"text":"Bomba de fisiune funcționează pe principiul că este necesară energie pentru a asambla un nucleu cu mulți protoni și neutroni."},{"kind":"audio","t":154992.66091900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154994.054287,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154995.68774000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154997.312413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154998.97709600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154999.840223,"samples":18111,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":162828.369475,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":163182.668974,"text":"În arhipelag și lacuri nu ai neapărat nevoie de un iaht."},{"kind":"audio","t":163265.62171,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163267.225303,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163268.08919,"samples":19448,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"close","t":174504.81383300002,"code":1005}]}